    dict(key='18-act-3-figure', kind='figure', title='More answers, fewer findings',
         body='stages',
         narration="Third demo: every answer changes the findings. [[slnc 400]] Each bar is the same bank at one stage. [[slnc 300]] With no answers, one hundred and seventy findings. [[slnc 300]] With encryption declared, thirty lines of answers, one hundred and sixty seven: three gone. [[slnc 300]] With authentication, one hundred and fifty nine: eight gone. [[slnc 300]] With access control and input handling, one hundred and eleven: forty eight gone, the biggest step. [[slnc 300]] With hardening, limits and logging, ninety four. [[slnc 600]] On the right, the check by hand. [[slnc 300]] The class Condition reads ninety one of the conditions itself, and checks them for every element at every stage. [[slnc 300]] Seven hundred and thirty checks. [[slnc 300]] All seven hundred and thirty give pytm's answer."),
